/E (We immediately defined frame perimeter and max height constraints as a vital factor in choosing which class we would select. Choosing the Mystic class was a clear disadvantage as its significantly smaller frame \(104" vs 120"\) and max height \(42" vs 60"\) meant that we would have to compromise on the complexity of subsystems like ground intakes, climbers and shooters. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
