348 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Additionally, we found the weight constraints to be a large consideration for the class we would choose. Having multiple different heavy subsystems on the robot would naturally favour a class that could carry more weight, which was the Commander class \(125 vs 100 lbs\). Although the Commander class could carry more weight, the heavier weight and nature of the panels would also offset this advantage, which displayed the need to lightweight our robot.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
